§ `Part XXV, section 772: levy under the writ`

-- (1) "Where a writ of fieri facias is issued pursuant to section 771, the sheriff to whom it is delivered shall execute the writ and deal with the proceeds thereof in the same manner in which he is authorized to execute
-- and deal with the proceeds of writs of fieri facias issued out of superior courts in the province in civil proceedings."  The sheriff is not among the core's `Party` constructors (NEEDS-CORE.md): a party type of this section is declared here.
DECLARE `s 772 party` IS ONE OF
    `s 772 the sheriff to whom the writ is delivered`

-- src:16603 | 772 (1) Where a writ of fieri facias is issued pursuant to section 771, the sheriff to whom it is delivered shall execute the writ and deal with the proceeds thereof in the same manner in which he is authorized to execute and deal with the proceeds of writs of fieri facias issued out of superior courts in the province in civil proceedings.
@ref s 772(1) (src:16603)
